{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13102080","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13102080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1310208001:1":{"text":"ひ――","source_cn":"殿……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB682D238C132B9D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310208002:1":{"text":"しーっ！外では名前で呼んでって言ったでしょ！","source_cn":"嘘！都说了出门不要这么叫……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA1231768AA0363C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310208003:1":{"text":"ごほんっ……エレナ様、あまり勝手に出歩かないでください。お父上が知ったら……","source_cn":"咳……亚莲娜小姐，这样到处乱跑很不安全，您父亲知道了会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E261C9DA0A33CFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310208004:1":{"text":"大丈夫よ。今回だけだから。","source_cn":"哎呀，没关系的，就这一次嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x668DC8B7A24E45A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310208005:1":{"text":"お願い、ロドリゴ。お父様には言わないで、ね？","source_cn":"拜托了，罗德里戈，不要告诉我父亲好不好？求你了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12540B4165DFB5A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310208006:1":{"text":"はぁ……分かりました。ですが、もうすぐお父上が到着しますよ……","source_cn":"可是……唉，好吧。不过您父亲很快就要抵达雪松镇了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F7B12E74B90B7BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310208007:1":{"text":"うう、分かったわ。お父様に怒られるのはごめんだもの。","source_cn":"父亲……唉，好吧。我也不想让他生气呀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32360433D9E4EB8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310208008:1":{"text":"それじゃあ、私はもう行くわ。","source_cn":"几位可爱的朋友，咱们祭典的时候再一起玩吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32807D14A54BF0E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310208009:1":{"text":"祭典でまた会いましょう！","source_cn":"你们可一定要来呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64E1C5B723D5B2B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310208010:1":{"text":"はい！また祭典でお会いしましょう！","source_cn":"嗯嗯，祭典的时候再见！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF452329612B8966","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:侍卫长罗德里戈":{"text":"護衛隊長のロドリゴ","source":"侍卫长罗德里戈","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:红发少女":{"text":"赤毛の少女","source":"红发少女","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker: